# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI / assistant tooling
#
# Rationale: assistant chat histories and local session state routinely capture
# whatever was on screen — file contents, paths, machine details, occasionally
# credentials. None of it belongs in a public repo. Shared *configuration*
# (CLAUDE.md, .claude/skills/) is deliberately kept tracked; only per-developer
# state and transcripts are ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Claude Code — keep CLAUDE.md and .claude/skills/ tracked; ignore local state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/plans/
.claude/todos/
.claude/history/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/projects/
.claude/hooks/*.local.*

# Other assistants / editors
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.cursorrules.local
.windsurf/
.aider*
.continue/
.cline/
.roo/
.gemini/
.antigravity/
.specstory/
.codeium/
.github/copilot-session*

# Generic assistant scratch space
.ai/
.ai-scratch/
*.ai-session.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JetBrains
#
# NOTE: .idea/ is deliberately NOT blanket-ignored — misc.xml, modules.xml and
# vcs.xml are the shareable project definition and are tracked on purpose.
# Only per-developer state below is ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/tasks.xml
.idea/usage.statistics.xml
.idea/dictionaries/
.idea/shelf/
.idea/httpRequests/
.idea/dataSources/
.idea/dataSources.local.xml
.idea/sonarlint/
*.iws

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / credentials — belt-and-braces alongside the anonymization hook
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/public*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.json
.netrc
.hf_token
.huggingface/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights & ML artifacts
#
# These are multi-GB and must never enter git history. Note especially that
# ultralytics downloads checkpoints into the *current working directory* on
# first run, so `yolo11*.pt` will otherwise appear at the repo root uninvited.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.bin
*.gguf
yolo*.pt
sam*.pt
models/
weights/
checkpoints/
.cache/huggingface/

# Pipeline inputs/outputs from local runs.
#
# input/ is where photos to segment live. The directory itself is tracked (via
# .gitkeep) so it exists in a fresh clone; everything dropped into it is ignored,
# because photographs of real people must never reach a public repo.
input/*
!input/.gitkeep
outputs/
out/
samples/

# Boundary-quality fixtures (image + hand-annotated ground-truth mask) for the
# metrics in metrics.py. Local-only on purpose: committing a fixture is what
# would turn boundary IoU into a CI gate, and there is no CI yet (#15) and no
# hand annotation to gate against. Scoring a model against a mask produced by a
# model would be circular. Revisit when #15 lands.
fixtures/
*.out.png
*.out.jpg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notebooks
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb

